G、退出码 3，message 含配置文件绝对路径和原因；stderr 中没有 TypeError。defects/a4-null-config 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\n\n任务图给的验收方向：\n- node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-012\n- node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-013\n- node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-014\n- node bin/cliworker.mjs paths --config config/cliworker.example.json\n\n测试层级：integration, unit\n\n## 非目标\n\n- 不改动 write_scope 之外的文件。\n- 不实现其他里程碑的任务。\n","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":54,"fileSize":2797,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/005/.collab/tasks/005/brief.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":54},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-253e6444-89f4-478d-9780-8d31af404e8f-3\nfc_6d96e540-87d3-929a-928c-59963d95ab36_0","startedAtMs":"1794077169266","completedAtMs":"1794077169483"},"model_call_id":"fe333896-d935-4c3c-a423-c9ca6f69698b-1-mep1","session_id":"55656fba-0f42-46d7-9d11-d4df87432f6e","timestamp_ms":1794077169640}
