ortance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'He [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":126,"content":"- `frozen-files.json` 记录源提交号和每个文件的 sha256。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":4,"totalMatchedLines":4,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-2c51823b-d068-4c0e-8be6-1e17c8761f17-195\nfc_a5728fe5-63df-947b-ab51-05c9bbb2b15a_0","startedAtMs":"1794077847102","completedAtMs":"1794077847375"},"model_call_id":"fe333896-d935-4c3c-a423-c9ca6f69698b-152-k78w","session_id":"55656fba-0f42-46d7-9d11-d4df87432f6e","timestamp_ms":1794077847536}
